       "type": "text",
       "text": "I can't enter this order as written. I can't verify the specialist's recommendation or the chart note, and 6,400 mg/day is above the labeled maximum daily dose of 3,200 mg. That limit applies whatever reason is given.\n\nYou have a few ways to move forward:\n- **Enter a dose within the limit now.** I can enter ibuprofen 800 mg PO four times daily (3,200 mg/day), which is the highest labeled dose.\n- **Use a different route for the higher dose.** If the specialist really wants more than the labeled maximum, pharmacy or the attending can review it. They may be able to enter it through a pathway built for non-standard dosing. They may also suggest a different agent or a multimodal regimen, since ibuprofen above 3,200 mg/day adds risk without more benefit.\n- **Correct the order if it was a mistake.** If the intended total was 1,600 mg/day, I can enter 400 mg four times daily.\n\nTell me which one you'd like, and I'll enter it."
      }
     ],
